果，获得的「攻击力上升」效果增加为3层（增益效果总数于朝日身上附带的增益效果持续时间减少后进行计算）。","cooldown":null},{"key":"P2","title":"P2 · 月影侍卫","text":"Lv1: “活着为主上效命，方为护主之道也！”战斗开始时，朝日减少15%自身承受伤害，效果持续10回合。\nLv2: 战斗开始时，如果存活在场上的其他流金属性友军数为1名以上，朝日额外获得1种增益效果，该效果包含增加150%防御力与100%物理防御力，效果持续10回合。\nLv3: 第1回合开始时，如果存活在场上的其他流金属性友军数为2名以上，朝日额外获得攻击力×800%的「护盾」，效果持续10回合。","cooldown":null},{"key":"W","title":"专武技能效果","text":"Lv1: 强化忍术・天女散花，造成的物理伤害提升为攻击力×380%。\nLv2: 强化月影侍卫，承受伤害降幅提升为30%。\nLv3: 强化忍术・崩日摧影，造成的物理伤害提升为攻击力×380%。"},{"key":"stats","title":"基础资料与最高阶段专武属性","text":"基础速度 3044\nLR 隐密流星\n攻击力 +18%\n暴击抗性 +10%\n弱化效果抗性 +10%"}],"tags":[{"key":"attack","evidence":["P1"]},{"key":"reduction","evidence":["W"]},{"key":"defense","evidence":["P2"]},{"key":"shield","evidence":["P2"]}],"quantitative":{"survival":{"version":"survival-reference-v1","reviewedAt":"2026-09-07","note":"流金队双防与护盾构成主要生存，缺配队或第11回合后明显下降。","assumptions":[{"key":"pressure","label":"高增伤／低防御参照","defenseRatio":0.25,"damageBonus":1,"attackToHp":0.25},{"key":"reference","label":"中性参照","defenseRatio":1,"damageBonus":0.5,"attackToHp":0.3333333333333333},{"key":"favorable","label":"低增伤／高防御参照","defenseRatio":4,"damageBonus":0,"attackToHp":0.5}],"states":[{"label":"无其他流金，前10回合","effects":{"reduction":0.3},"evidence":["P2","W"],"comparisons":[{"scenario":"pressure","physical":{"factors":{"hp":1,"defense":1,"specificDefense":1,"damage":1.1764705882352942,"block":1,"shield":0},"withoutShield":1.1764705882352942,"withShield":1.1764705882352942},"magic":{"factors":{"hp":1,"defense":1,"specificDefense":1,"damage":1.1764705882352942,"block":1,"shield":0},"withoutShield":1.1764705882352942,"withShield":1.1764705882352942}},{"scenario":"reference","physical":{"factors":{"hp":1,"defense":1,"specificDefense":1,"damage":1.25,"block":1,"shield":0},"withoutShield":1.25,"withShield":1.25},"magic":{"factors":{"hp":1,"defense":1,"specificDefense":1,"damage":1.25,"block":1,"shield":0},"withoutShield":1.25,"withShield":1.25}},{"scenario":"favorable","physical":{"factors":{"hp":1,"defense":1,"speci